  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australia-Vietnam partnership for equitable and inclusive socio-economic development (Aus4Equality)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment is a flagship of the Australia-Vietnam Development Partnership Plan 2025-2030. Aus4Equality contributes to the Plan&#x2019;s fourth objective &#x201c;All Vietnamese people participate in and benefit from social and economic development&#x201d;. The investment aligns with the Australia in Vietnam Equality Strategy (2022-2027) which deepens Australia&#x2019;s efforts on gender equality and women&#x2019;s and girls&#x2019; empowerment, social and economic inclusion of people with disabilities, ethnic minority groups and LGBTQIA+ people.
Aus4Equality&#x2019;s overall purpose is for women, ethnic minorities and people with disabilities to participate in and benefit from sustainable economic opportunities. It focuses on women entrepreneurs in the tourism and agriculture sectors in the Northwest of Vietnam</narrative>
  </description>
